(6634497, 990814, 94265, '<td valign="top">I normally like high-key shots but there''s a bit too much detail lost for me. Perhaps if the remaining details were sharper I''d have liked it more but I''m just not keen on the processing personally. Nice model though.</td>', 'I normally like high-key shots but there''s a bit too much detail lost for me. Perhaps if the remaining details were sharper I''d have liked it more but I''m just not keen on the processing personally. Nice model though.', '2012-01-04 12:06:01.000000', NULL, 1),
