(6638071, 990857, 94815, '<td valign="top">I rarely comment but this I had to mention for its impact that just misses - and a solution that my eye ssys is so simple to put the "bull" back in the dog. It needs a crop from both sides to focus more on the dog and give it the monumentality that its pov and pose command. As is, there are too many similar trees that dilute the concept. An 8 for what could have been and a 6 for what is - avg 7.</td>', 'I rarely comment but this I had to mention for its impact that just misses - and a solution that my eye ssys is so simple to put the "bull" back in the dog. It needs a crop from both sides to focus more on the dog and give it the monumentality that its pov and pose command. As is, there are too many similar trees that dilute the concept. An 8 for what could have been and a 6 for what is - avg 7.', '2012-01-07 22:43:29.000000', NULL, 1),
