(6641745, 990987, 30364, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Krisby:</b></div><hr/><i> Waaayy to much going on in one shot.. this, im sorry to say, is photographicly nothing more than a snap shot. It would have helped you maybe a tiny bit to crop out the unnessisery sides, both the sheet and the hose. Then there would at least be fewer objects to distract the eye. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Oh!  Well I''m glad we got all that sorted out then.  Hope you were paying close attention, Nick.<br/> <br/>I didn''t vote nor even look, but I''d probably have failed to spot the many flaws in your picture and given it a high mark.</td>', 'Originally posted by Krisby: Waaayy to much going on in one shot.. this, im sorry to say, is photographicly nothing more than a snap shot. It would have helped you maybe a tiny bit to crop out the unnessisery sides, both the sheet and the hose. Then there would at least be fewer objects to distract the eye.  Oh!  Well I''m glad we got all that sorted out then.  Hope you were paying close attention, Nick. I didn''t vote nor even look, but I''d probably have failed to spot the many flaws in your picture and given it a high mark.', '2012-01-11 00:30:11.000000', NULL, 0),
