(6642690, 990710, 118039, '<td valign="top">Thank you all for you lovely comments and votes. Its an honor to get this 5th position. I guess I got a little lucky because we were visiting Yosemite and happen to take this HDR photo. When I came back, I just had to find a username which I could use for this photo.<br/> <br/>I have always followed all the competitions and am a big fan of this website. Love the work of a lot of the photographers and its an honor for me to  get 5th position in this competition. Hopefully I can keep the momentum going and get some more of of these in this year :)</td>', 'Thank you all for you lovely comments and votes. Its an honor to get this 5th position. I guess I got a little lucky because we were visiting Yosemite and happen to take this HDR photo. When I came back, I just had to find a username which I could use for this photo. I have always followed all the competitions and am a big fan of this website. Love the work of a lot of the photographers and its an honor for me to  get 5th position in this competition. Hopefully I can keep the momentum going and get some more of of these in this year :)', '2012-01-11 21:11:33.000000', NULL, 0),
