(6642751, 991030, 141542, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by brucedgates:</b></div><hr/><i> The colors here are very muted. The beach looks cold to me and the children taken at such a distance... This feels like simply a snapshot. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Great snapshot, vlado.  My favorite thing about this snapshot is how it follows nearly every fundamental of good photography, the level horizon, the rule of thirds, and not to mention this very interesting human interaction taking place.  My primary criticism of it, though, is its general snapsnottishness.  Yes, that''s a word.<br/> <br/>So yeah, overall just a really wonderful snapshot that someone would probably pay good money for to hang in their home.</td>', 'Originally posted by brucedgates: The colors here are very muted. The beach looks cold to me and the children taken at such a distance... This feels like simply a snapshot.   Great snapshot, vlado.  My favorite thing about this snapshot is how it follows nearly every fundamental of good photography, the level horizon, the rule of thirds, and not to mention this very interesting human interaction taking place.  My primary criticism of it, though, is its general snapsnottishness.  Yes, that''s a word. So yeah, overall just a really wonderful snapshot that someone would probably pay good money for to hang in their home.', '2012-01-11 22:21:20.000000', NULL, 0),
