(6645122, 991070, 43463, '<td valign="top">Perfect presentation of the name. You were very fortunate to be in the right place at the right time. Love the golden glow of the rising paper lanterns that complement the golden glow of the temple spire. This is truly a breathtaking moment of time captured beautifully. Congratulations on the ribbon! One of my very few 10''s.</td>', 'Perfect presentation of the name. You were very fortunate to be in the right place at the right time. Love the golden glow of the rising paper lanterns that complement the golden glow of the temple spire. This is truly a breathtaking moment of time captured beautifully. Congratulations on the ribbon! One of my very few 10''s.', '2012-01-14 21:27:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(6645126, 990907, 43463, '<td valign="top">Have not been to Hearst Castle in ages (I wonder if the main highway still has some mountains of claim shells off to the side of the road or has the foliage grown over it). This is the indoor pool if memory serves correct (the outdoor pool was twice this size and also had grecian/roman decor). Truly nice capture of the rich blues and golds of the room. The wide view makes it feel huge which is in direct contrast to the reflections in the water of the roof beams which creates a cocoon-like enclosed feeling.</td>', 'Have not been to Hearst Castle in ages (I wonder if the main highway still has some mountains of claim shells off to the side of the road or has the foliage grown over it). This is the indoor pool if memory serves correct (the outdoor pool was twice this size and also had grecian/roman decor). Truly nice capture of the rich blues and golds of the room. The wide view makes it feel huge which is in direct contrast to the reflections in the water of the roof beams which creates a cocoon-like enclosed feeling.', '2012-01-14 21:38:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(6645128, 990403, 43463, '<td valign="top">I LOVE the display of vibrant colors here! It really captures and holds the eye. Great detail and great emote on the clown! I was surprised not to find this in the top 10 for it dazzles the eye with color &amp; playfulness and fits the challenge name perfectly.</td>', 'I LOVE the display of vibrant colors here! It really captures and holds the eye. Great detail and great emote on the clown! I was surprised not to find this in the top 10 for it dazzles the eye with color & playfulness and fits the challenge name perfectly.', '2012-01-14 21:43:16.000000', NULL, 0),
